\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"51a01fb8-5cf0-9e43-a155-505081102b2a"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook extends the toroidal geometry module by adding: \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"94e9a2b8-bfe1-5047-be35-9527e6412bd4"],

Cell["a torus-compatible scalar field operator,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"7a455179-8fde-7a46-a038-f3d2b93ac73e"],

Cell["linearization about a background toroidal mode,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"d75f13e0-b12c-1042-92cd-19a01c7d7638"],

Cell["Fourier-mode eigenspectrum formulas on the flat torus proxy,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"8ce4d757-2f41-1c4e-bbaa-6871e7ab62c0"],

Cell["numerical matrix-based eigenspectrum tests,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"981aff48-a491-8e4e-a02c-4b5f2e1ff1aa"],

Cell["convergence-under-resolution checks,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ff06c66f-2763-1146-a06e-dfb9be410171"],

